            "text": "Not at all. A candle is a symbol and a carrier of the fire element, but a small lamp, a stick of incense, or simply an open window with moonlight coming in all serve the same role. The core of a ritual is focused attention; the tools only help you arrive there. When the heart is present, the ritual is complete."
